Description: Terminal client and shared backend for OpenVPN 3 Linux
 Manage profiles, sessions and traffic in a keyboard-driven curses interface.
 Runs in local consoles, VM consoles and SSH without graphical libraries.
 Includes the shared backend used by the optional openvpn3-gui package.
